# Version control
.git
**/.git
.github

# Dependencies & build artifacts (installed/built inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/dist
**/build
**/out

# Secrets — NEVER copy into an image (provided at runtime via env_file / mounts)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/config.env
**/*.pem
**/certs/

# Docs, plans, scratch (not needed to build/run)
docs/
*.docx
**/*.md
.claude

# Mobile source is not part of the web/api images — keep only its manifest so
# the npm workspace install can validate the lockfile.
halaa-mobile/*
!halaa-mobile/package.json

# Local test/deploy scaffolding
deploy-*.sh
